Package: desktop-remote-mobile-companion
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Richard Smith <deb@electronstudio.co.uk>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Homepage: https://github.com/electronstudio/desktop_remote_mobile_companion
Description: Use a mobile device as a wireless trackpad and graphics tablet
 Connect your mobile device wirelessly to your PC and use it as a
 multitouch trackpad, graphics tablet, etc. The package provides the
 'companion' CLI server and the 'companion_gui' desktop application.
 The server streams the desktop to the phone and injects the phone's
 pointer input via uinput; file capabilities (cap_sys_admin et al.) are
 granted to the binaries at install time so DRM desktop capture works
 without running as root.
